              "raw": "{\n  \"legal_name\": \"Legal Name\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Create a new entity. The optional `ein` and `xero_tenant_id` fields must be unique across non-deleted entities; a duplicate value returns 409. An `individual` or `household` entity must not set `ein`, `formation_state`, or `formation_date` (422).",
