              "raw": "{\n  \"accounting_record_id\": \"string\",\n  \"business_address\": \"string\",\n  \"business_city\": \"string\",\n  \"business_state\": \"string\",\n  \"business_zip\": \"string\",\n  \"dba_names\": \"string\",\n  \"ein\": \"string\",\n  \"entity_type\": \"llc\",\n  \"fiscal_year_end\": \"string\",\n  \"formation_date\": \"2026-01-01\",\n  \"formation_state\": \"string\",\n  \"is_active\": false,\n  \"legal_name\": \"string\",\n  \"mailing_address\": \"string\",\n  \"mailing_city\": \"string\",\n  \"mailing_state\": \"string\",\n  \"mailing_zip\": \"string\",\n  \"notes\": \"string\",\n  \"purpose\": \"string\",\n  \"xero_tenant_id\": \"string\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Partially update an entity. Only fields included in the request body are modified. Updating `ein` or `xero_tenant_id` to a value already held by another entity returns 409. Sending `xero_tenant_id: null` clears the mapping.",
